1249	  - **`dayMixesOffsets`**: the day's slots have more than one distinct `offsetMinutes`.
1250	  - **`zoneOptions`**:
1251	    - Start with `COMMON_ZONES`, then `Intl.supportedValuesOf('timeZone')`, dropping any zone already present canonically.
